		(descr "TI BQ24074RGT, VQFN-16 (RGT) 3x3mm, 0.5mm pitch, 1.68mm exposed pad (TI nominal; 1.70 lands exactly on the 0.2mm clearance boundary). Thermal vias 0.3mm drill on 0.70mm pads at +/-0.45mm (0.20mm annular ring, JLC floor is 0.18): JLC will not do 0.2mm holes, and TI\\'s +/-0.6 position leaves only 0.176mm to the signal pads at that pad size. Land pattern per SLUS810N RGT0016C drawing 4222419/E. EP paste segmented 2x2 at 72% coverage; the 4 thermal vias sit under the apertures and MUST be tented/mask-plugged.")
